Subject: [PATCH 11/39] Plutonium: the shell pairs with the launcher's token
 only when it needs to

The launcher offers a one-time token as #plutoniumPair= on every start,
with the desktop app's scopes (pairing other devices among them). It
becomes T3's #token= only when the browser isn't paired, or its session
lacks some of those scopes (a profile paired before), so a paired profile
doesn't add a session each time.

